+// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
+// Sub-component: Resume Brief — compact summary-first layer
+// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
+//
+// Replaces the cognitive load of scanning multiple panels by surfacing the
+// five most important resume signals in a single calm strip. Designed to
